Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:53.90,HEADA,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}▍{\r\fn得意黑}2026 辛辛那提 WTA1000 1/4决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:01:53.90,HEADB,,0,0,0,,{\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\c&H8CDC4A&}贝莱克 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}3-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}6-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}4 {\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\c&H8CDC4A&\fs44}7-{\r\fnBarlow Condensed SemiBold\fs44}6(5){\r\fnNoto Sans CJK SC} 凯斯 · 赛后场上采访
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.64,EN,,0,0,0,,through to your first semi-final
Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,打进了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:05.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in a Masters 1000 tournament and boy,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.64,0:00:05.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,你人生第一个大师赛半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:09.56,EN,,0,0,0,,you had your work cut out for you today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:09.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,而且这一路走得相当不容易
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:11.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Yeah, how does it feel?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.56,0:00:11.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在是什么感觉？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:13.12,EN,,0,0,0,,I mean, you see you see me right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.04,0:00:13.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你现在看我这个样子就知道了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:13.96,EN,,0,0,0,,It's incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:13.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,简直难以置信
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.56,EN,,0,0,0,,I'm super happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.96,0:00:15.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,我太开心了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:16.80,EN,,0,0,0,,You mixed things up today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.56,0:00:16.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天打法很多变
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.56,EN,,0,0,0,,You gave Maddie a hard time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.80,0:00:18.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,让凯斯很不好受
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.08,EN,,0,0,0,,A lot of these players are go big
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.56,0:00:20.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,现在很多球员
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:20.64,EN,,0,0,0,,or go home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.08,0:00:20.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,要么放手一搏要么认输
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,You mixed it up a lot today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.64,0:00:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今天变化打得很多
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.84,EN,,0,0,0,,You knew exactly what to do in order
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.12,0:00:23.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,你很清楚该怎么做
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.68,EN,,0,0,0,,to get yourself out of trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.84,0:00:25.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,才能从困境里走出来
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:26.44,EN,,0,0,0,,How proud are you
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.68,0:00:26.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,你对今天这场胜利
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.56,EN,,0,0,0,,of your accomplishment today
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.44,0:00:27.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,有多自豪？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:28.84,EN,,0,0,0,,and let's just talk a little bit
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.56,0:00:28.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,我们也聊聊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.40,EN,,0,0,0,,about what made it so difficult for Maddie
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:31.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,今天凯斯为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:33.84,EN,,0,0,0,,to take control of this match today?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.40,0:00:33.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,很难掌控局面？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:38.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I was just playing what I felt, how I felt.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.84,0:00:38.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我就是凭感觉在打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.36,EN,,0,0,0,,I wasn't really thinking what should I
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,没有去想
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:42.80,EN,,0,0,0,,do, what my coach told me before.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.36,0:00:42.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,该怎么做 教练之前交代过什么
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I totally forgot everything
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.80,0:00:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,一上场
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.72,EN,,0,0,0,,when I came on the court.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.40,0:00:45.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,就把这些全忘了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:46.80,EN,,0,0,0,,So,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:46.80,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.28,EN,,0,0,0,,what I felt I played and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.80,0:00:49.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,就跟着感觉去打
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:50.96,EN,,0,0,0,,that was the key today.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.28,0:00:50.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,这就是今天获胜的关键
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:52.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Tell me, before you go off,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.96,0:00:52.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,在你离开之前问一句
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.16,EN,,0,0,0,,what have you learned about yourself in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.52,0:00:54.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几天
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:56.96,EN,,0,0,0,,last few days defeating Aryna Sabalenka,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.16,0:00:56.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,你先赢了萨巴伦卡
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.16,EN,,0,0,0,,a Grand Slam champion,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.96,0:00:58.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,一位大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:00:59.96,EN,,0,0,0,,you defeated Madison Keys,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.16,0:00:59.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,又赢了凯斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:01.68,EN,,0,0,0,,a Grand Slam champion.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.96,0:01:01.68,ZH,,0,0,0,,也是大满贯冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:02.84,EN,,0,0,0,,What have you learned about yourself
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.68,0:01:02.84,ZH,,0,0,0,,这几天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.72,EN,,0,0,0,,in the last few days?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.84,0:01:04.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,你学到了什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:07.76,EN,,0,0,0,,Probably to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.72,0:01:07.76,ZH,,0,0,0,,大概是要相信自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:10.44,EN,,0,0,0,,I believe much more than I ever believed
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.76,0:01:10.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我比以往任何时候
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:13.56,EN,,0,0,0,,in myself.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.44,0:01:13.56,ZH,,0,0,0,,都更相信自己
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.16,EN,,0,0,0,,So, I just keep believing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.84,0:01:16.16,ZH,,0,0,0,,所以我就一直相信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.08,EN,,0,0,0,,in the match no matter what and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.16,0:01:19.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,不管场上怎样都相信
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.12,EN,,0,0,0,,that's probably the thing which is always
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.08,0:01:22.12,ZH,,0,0,0,,这大概就是
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.44,EN,,0,0,0,,in my head.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.12,0:01:23.44,ZH,,0,0,0,,我心里一直想的事
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:24.36,EN,,0,0,0,,Will you watch tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:24.36,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚你会看比赛吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:26.28,EN,,0,0,0,,Marta Kostyuk's playing Coco Gauff.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:26.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,科斯秋克对阵高芙
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:27.32,EN,,0,0,0,,I haven't played Coco,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.28,0:01:27.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,高芙我还没交手过
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:29.04,EN,,0,0,0,,Marta you've beaten once before.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.32,0:01:29.04,ZH,,0,0,0,,科斯秋克你之前赢过一次
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.00,EN,,0,0,0,,Will you watch tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.04,0:01:30.00,ZH,,0,0,0,,你今晚会看吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.20,EN,,0,0,0,,Will you tune it out?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:31.20,ZH,,0,0,0,,还是不看？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.32,EN,,0,0,0,,What are your plans for tonight?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.20,0:01:33.32,ZH,,0,0,0,,今晚有什么安排？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.08,EN,,0,0,0,,I will take a good dinner.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.32,0:01:35.08,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要去好好吃顿饭
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.48,EN,,0,0,0,,I will leave this job on my team and let's see
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.08,0:01:38.48,ZH,,0,0,0,,剩下的交给团队
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:41.72,EN,,0,0,0,,what they will tell me tomorrow and yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.48,0:01:41.72,ZH,,0,0,0,,看看他们明天怎么安排
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.40,EN,,0,0,0,,I will try to rest and to be ready tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.72,0:01:44.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,我要好好休息 准备好明天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:45.64,EN,,0,0,0,,All right, we wish you the best of luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.40,0:01:45.64,ZH,,0,0,0,,好的 祝你好运
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:46.52,EN,,0,0,0,,Congratulations.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.64,0:01:46.52,ZH,,0,0,0,,恭喜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.28,EN,,0,0,0,,High five.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.52,0:01:48.28,ZH,,0,0,0,,击个掌
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:49.96,EN,,0,0,0,,She is through to the semi-finals.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.28,0:01:49.96,ZH,,0,0,0,,她打进了半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:51.40,EN,,0,0,0,,Everybody, what a big day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.96,0:01:51.40,ZH,,0,0,0,,各位 今天真是精彩的一天
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.90,EN,,0,0,0,,Very likable, isn't she?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.40,0:01:53.90,ZH,,0,0,0,,她真讨人喜欢 对吧？
